# Two instances, one session, one variable each way. The base every other scenario builds on.
#
# Run:  DrovaCoopMod.TestRunner scenarios/smoke.coop
# Needs a relay reachable with the mod's configured settings, exactly as coop_host does.

include session.coop

# A flag set on one side must land on the other, and a clear must come back.
A setgvar QuestVars_FeedingTheSheep TalkedToPost 1
B expect gvar QuestVars_FeedingTheSheep TalkedToPost == 1 timeout=15
B setgvar QuestVars_FeedingTheSheep TalkedToPost 0
A expect gvar QuestVars_FeedingTheSheep TalkedToPost == 0 timeout=15

# The stuck-toggle fix: A sets it again after B cleared it; B must follow.
A setgvar QuestVars_FeedingTheSheep TalkedToPost 1
B expect gvar QuestVars_FeedingTheSheep TalkedToPost == 1 timeout=15

A run coop_status
B run coop_status
